/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   KOKTEILBARINN — Klapparstígur 28-30, Reykjavík. Content source of truth.

   EVERY string here is either (a) taken verbatim from the bar's own
   published material, or (b) written by us and marked. Nothing is invented
   about the business.

   PRIMARY SOURCES (all fetched 2026-08-19)
   ----------------------------------------
   • Cocktails, tags, ingredients, prices — kokteilbarinn.is/kokteillistar/
     (their menu is real HTML — rare and to their credit; transcribed as-is,
     including the tag lines whose first build word is SHORT / LONG / ROCKS).
   • SAGA NEGRONI — same page, their own dated 1860→2008 progression.
   • GIN FIX + the 45 ml / 120 ml ratio sentence — same page, verbatim.
   • Wine, champagne, beer — same page.
   • Happy hour menu and prices — kokteilbarinn.is/happy-hour/ ("Alla daga
     milli 14-18", plus "AÐRIR KOKTEILBARS KOKTEILAR Á 25% AFSLÆTTI").
   • BCA 2022 winner icons — their own front page (wp-content/uploads/2022/08/
     bca_winner_icon_22_{bartender,newbar,restaurant,signature}.png).
   • Address, phone, e-mail, group booking line — monkeys.is/en/about and the
     group's Dineout page ("We don't do reservations at The Cocktail bar.
     It opens at 14:00 every day.").
   • Operator — fyrirtækjaskrá: Aðeins meiri klaka takk fyrir ehf.,
     kt. 6101210200, Klapparstíg 30, skráð 2021.
   • Photographs — their own WordPress media library (full-res via unsized
     paths) and monkeys.is /myndir. The room IS the concept: the bar is built
     as a first-class train carriage — "THE COCK TAIL TRAIN" is painted on
     the bar front in their own photos.

   NOT CLAIMED ANYWHERE ON THE PAGE
   --------------------------------
   • Any opening year. • Any staff name (their site names none for the bar).
   • What the four BCA icons were won FOR beyond the words in the icons
     themselves — they are shown as published, with the source stated.
   • Which drink a photograph shows, beyond what is visible in frame.
   ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

